00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:05,520
I've made a decision at one point, but, and you can define what that means for you.

386
00:34:05,520 --> 00:34:08,440
Maybe you're way off track or maybe you're just a little bit off track,

387
00:34:08,520 --> 00:34:10,820
but you know that today is a day for you to make a decision.

388
00:34:10,820 --> 00:34:14,960
I'm going to stop the trajectory of my life that is leading me away from the rock.

389
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:16,260
And I'm coming back.

390
00:34:16,260 --> 00:34:18,320
I'm resubmitting my life to Jesus this morning.

391
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:21,480
If that's you, I want to invite you here in a minute.

392
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:22,120
We're going to sing.

393
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:29,640
And I'd love to invite anybody that's here and that's feeling that way to come up and grab a rock.

394
00:34:29,640 --> 00:34:34,620
There's Sharpies, write the date, write whatever it is that the Lord's leading you to do.

395
00:34:34,620 --> 00:34:42,200
Think about this and take this rock home and carry it with you and put it somewhere you can see it and remind yourself.

396
00:34:44,280 --> 00:34:48,360
I'm choosing today to continue to build my life on the rock.

397
00:34:48,360 --> 00:34:51,560
And maybe you're in here and you've never made this decision.

398
00:34:53,440 --> 00:34:57,780
I want you to also have the opportunity for the first time ever to come up and grab a rock.

