00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:42,400
that you'll ever hear.

411
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:46,760
If you build your life on the faith in and obedience to Jesus' teaching,

412
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:49,920
you will persevere any storm that you face.

413
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:56,200
So if you're here and you want to decide for the first time to follow Jesus,

